+// propose in two halves (IK2_K_SWIN: the window queued behind the drafts with no host wait between): its launches
+// (nothing waited for), then - after a wait that covers them - the drafts.  draft_tokens: the device's copy of the
+// last step's drafts [kBlock - 1], for launches that read them on the device.
